      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC10213035::web::004::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cu-rich precipitates have sufficiently high thermal conductivity to improve heat transfer through the alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An interconnected Cu-rich network will create preferential heat-transfer pathways through enhanced electron and phonon transport.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refractory matrix will preserve mechanical strength under cyclic thermal and mechanical loading.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::004::introduction",
        "PMC10213035::web::010::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will remain structurally functional at operating temperatures of 600–800°C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::004::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will remain structurally functional under cyclic thermal and mechanical loads representative of a plasma-facing intermediate layer.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will improve effective thermal conductivity by approximately 20% relative to the undoped refractory HEA.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cu-doped alloy will retain the yield strength needed for plasma-facing applications.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::004::introduction",
        "PMC10213035::web::010::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
